    "en": {
      "text": "Powered Heavy Attacks grant 'Arc Conductor' for 6 seconds.\n\nWhile Arc Conductor is active, gain <pve 50% /> <pvp [15%] /> Damage Resistance to <arc/>Arc Damage and emit chain lightning around you in a 12 meter radius every 0.25 seconds, dealing <pve 171 /> <pvp [26] /> damage per tick. On single targets, a bonus second tick triggers every 1.5 seconds.\n\nLightning is treated as sword damage.\n\nBuff is removed on stow.",
